{
  "quest.52AC92FEEDB40F4F.quest_desc": [
    "不是每个人都擅长建筑, 没关系!完成此任务, 可以从五座预建住宅中任选一座, 直接放进世界!",
    "",
    "奖励以&a结构放置器&r的形式发放, 一次就能建好整座房子.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "手持放置器, 看向30格内的地面, 即可预览放置位置; 右键点击即可建造.屏幕提示中列出了固定位置, 旋转和微调所用的按键.",
    "",
    "房屋占用的每一格都必须是空气, 或草等可替换的方块.如果被树木或山坡挡住, 就会提示放置区域无效, 且不会开始建造.因此请先找一片平坦, 空旷的地方.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&l温馨小屋&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/classic-20260928-160754.png width:180 height:100 align:center fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&l奥术小屋&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/magic-20260928-160907.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&l纳米小筑&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/tech-20260928-160936.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&l夏尔居所&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/hobbit-20260928-160829.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&l瞭望塔&r",
    "{image:ftb:textures/structure/tower-20260928-160948.png width:180 height:100 align:left fit:true click_action:none:}",
    "{@pagebreak}"
  ],
  "quest.01583CD13DE25A1C.title": "&6匠神锻造&r",
  "quest.65457E1A8AAEDF51.quest_desc": [
    "你知道吗?你的角色足够强壮, 徒手就能打断一棵粗壮的大树!",
    "",
    "&o去撸树吧.&r",
    "",
    "[\"\",\"整合包里有海量战利品可收集, 送你一个\",{\"text\":\"背包\",\"color\":\"green\"},\"!把它装备在饰品栏中, 再按\",{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.open_backpack\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"默认: B\"}},\",不用取下背包也能打开它.\"]"
  ],
  "quest.795D11D12A8F53E2.title": "&b存储与资源",
  "task.01E9525916A38B8E.title": "扫描模块",
  "quest.2B396BAC38F76E44.title": "&d魔法模组",
  "quest.65457E1A8AAEDF51.quest_subtitle": "开砍!",
  "quest.3242DFBF0D574B6E.title": "末影接口入门",
  "quest.6D79D4AAD0431D98.quest_desc": [
    "获得&a铁镐&r后, 采矿之路才算真正打开.",
    "",
    "&a提示&r: 大多数模组都要消耗大量&e铁&r, 不妨考虑搭建&a冶炼炉&r, 让粗矿石产出更多金属."
  ],
  "quest.6D79D4AAD0431D98.title": "铁制工具",
  "quest.7EFD51F029547AFF.title": "初期存储",
  "quest.0270ADB3945D2C1A.quest_desc": [
    "&eScannable&r加入了&a扫描器&r, 可以帮你透过墙壁寻找矿石.",
    "",
    "安装扫描模块后, 按住右键进行扫描, 即可高亮显示周围的方块或矿石.",
    "",
    "扫描器需要能量, 随身携带一个&a便携发电器&r就很适合为它充电!"
  ],
  "quest.4278C6A88AE6F6D4.title": "制作合金",
  "task.2CDF75AE6BB56973.title": "基础电路",
  "quest.2B396BAC38F76E44.quest_desc": [
    "也许你喜欢绚丽的魔法模组.毕竟, 每个人的生活偶尔都需要一点魔法.",
    "",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"魔法艺术\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"3070FD15982582F5\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开魔法艺术\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"邪恶工艺\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"31FD9EA513E0D010\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开邪恶工艺\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"Neo Vitae\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"3EC0F38A5F8D01E2\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开Neo Vitae\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"神秘学\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"10F792474C01A594\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开神秘学\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"圣遗物\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"71F0A28C67E53A01\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开圣遗物\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"根源魔法\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"276D73B7CB872EB4\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开根源魔法\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"巫术\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"720DB36A13C6BBDC\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开巫术\"}}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A892B55276CEEE3.title": "璞石中的钻石",
  "quest.209C086AC37B0B44.quest_desc": [
    "&6FTB Evolution 2&r中会偶尔发生影响周围世界的事件.",
    "",
    "使用&b/events toggle ftb:[event_name]&r, 可以按喜好关闭或重新开启某个事件.",
    "",
    "&3悦灵&r: 一只友善的悦灵会出现, 提出用一种物品换取另一种物品.",
    "",
    "&3山羊&r: 一只山羊会出现并试图冲撞你, 随后掉落一份小奖励.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&3青蛙&r: 在附近水域生成青蛙和鱿鱼.",
    "",
    "&3精灵&r: 一只友善的隐形精灵会给你一点增益, 然后离开.",
    "",
    "&3商人&r: 流浪者公会中的某位商人前来拜访, 出售各种有助于冒险的物品.",
    "",
    "&3幻翼&r: 夜间会出现一只发光的幻翼, 试图把铁砧扔到你头上.幸好, 它扔得不太准.",
    "",
    "&3枪手&r: 在快捷栏中携带枪械时, 可能会有枪手向你发起决斗.等待倒计时, 看到DRAW(拔枪)提示后再开火.获胜可得到子弹和硬币."
  ],
  "task.0F1858239A75514D.title": "初期发电机",
  "task.3C60E5FEF7533AAB.title": "合金设备",
  "quest.30BAA2AC524A2ACD.title": "吃得好才是真的好",
  "quest.65457E1A8AAEDF51.title": "白手起家",
  "quest.6DD06EC00EE795D9.quest_desc": [
    "探索, 战斗, 以及你在世界中的各种活动, 都可以参考这些章节:",
    "",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"探索\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"7F209ECB076B2B30\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开探索\"}},\":结构, 生物群系, 首领和各类商人.\"]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"整装待发\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"37F99696A47264FD\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开整装待发\"}},\":神化装备, 附魔和饰品.\"]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"冰火传说\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"199022E0BC1A489E\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开冰火传说\"}},\":巨龙, 以及用巨龙材料制作的装备.\"]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"悬赏板\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"20D7DA6055C540FA\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开悬赏板\"}},\":可重复完成的击杀悬赏与游玩时长悬赏.\"]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"极光\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"780B8C00D01127EB\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开极光\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"共鸣\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"4A4DCCA388BB4131\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开共鸣\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"烹饪与酿造\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"7D090A60681CC97D\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开烹饪与酿造\"}},\":食物与饮品.\"]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"高效农业\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"33F929B0D52A951D\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开高效农业\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"建筑与装饰\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"377E6E387004CA7E\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开建筑与装饰\"}},\":装饰方块.\"]"
  ],
  "quest.4C4B66375F395436.quest_desc": [
    "结契后的灵伴会通过两种独立的方式成长, 二者都从结契时开始生效.",
    "",
    "将灵伴的羁绊等级提升至5级, 即可启用它的特殊能力.",
    "",
    "- &3羁绊&r: 灵伴被召唤出来且在你32格范围内时, 每秒获得一点羁绊; 你挂机时不会增长.喂食它的驯服物品可额外提升羁绊, 每十分钟只能生效一次.羁绊最高30级, 还能加快升级, 解锁更多储物槽, 并缩短复活等待时间.",
    "- &3等级&r: 灵伴在附近时, 会获得相当于你所得经验一半的经验值.每升一级都会提升生命值, 攻击力, 护甲和速度, 最高30级.达到30级后, 可以转生获得一颗星, 最多五颗.",
    "",
    "&c警告&r: 羁绊超过10级后, 灵伴每次死亡都会降低一级羁绊.使用护符让它复活."
  ],
  "quest.25B2D69A3A827D18.title": "&d你的专属灵伴",
  "quest.7EFD51F029547AFF.quest_desc": [
    "&a箱子&r很适合初期储物, 但这里可是模组世界.使用&e精妙存储&r, 就能直接升级世界中的箱子, 装下更多物品.",
    "",
    "对已放置的箱子使用&a基础升级&r, 就能将其变成&e精妙存储&r的箱子, 内部物品也会保留.之后同样可以用等级升级, 将箱子从铜级一路升到下界合金级.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"精妙存储\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"3ACF3359B3B59A05\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开精妙存储任务\"}},\"任务位于通用存储章节, 介绍了各个等级与升级.\"]"
  ],
  "quest.52243EEF2C055424.quest_desc": [
    "&eJust Dire Things&r通过把方块放在黏液旁来转化方块.第一阶黏液能将铁变成比普通铁更坚韧的核源铁.",
    "",
    "制作并放置一个&a原初浆凝胶&r.先用它生产&a粗核源铁&r, 再熔炼成核源铁锭.",
    "",
    "刚放下的黏液处于休眠状态, 用&2腐肉&r激活它(&7糖&r也可以).接着将&2铁块&r贴在它任意一侧, 一段时间后铁块就会变成粗核源铁矿簇, 挖掘后掉落3或4个&a粗核源铁&r.",
    "",
    "&e注意&r: 黏液每转化一个方块后, 都有10%的概率再次休眠.已经进行中的转化仍会完成, 但重新喂食前不会开始新的转化."
  ],
  "quest.3BDC1484FE89DE9D.title": "发射燃料",
  "quest.30BAA2AC524A2ACD.quest_subtitle": "黏黏有余.",
  "quest.1DD27C056EB93771.quest_desc": [
    "如果你喜欢机器和工厂, 不妨看看以下章节.",
    "",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"巨型反应堆\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"4E45AACCDF8A2570\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开巨型反应堆\"}}]",
    "[\"\",\"- \",{\"text\":\"末影接口\",\"color\":\"aqua\",\"underlined\":true,\"click_event\":{\"id\":\"ftbquests:link\",\"payload\":{\"quest_id\":\"566EEDD0B029090D\",\"page\":1},\"action\":\"custom\"},\"hover_event\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"value\":\"打开末影接口\"}}]",
